// Q-031 There is no way to comment inside markup: `// note` there is shown on the page
// mode: run
// open-when: // a note for whoever
// fixed-when: <div><p>x</p></div>
// From FEEDBACK3.md §4 (found on 896e758). `{/* note */}` (as in JSX) and `{// note}` are parse
// errors; the language has no block comments at all.

view Card() = <div>
    // a note for whoever edits this
    <p>x</p>
</div>

print(str(Card()))
